sed as a key equivalent as long as pressing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it produces a single character value. Key equivalents are typically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initialized using a single-character string literal, with constants for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unprintable or hard-to-type values.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier keys necessary to type a key equivalent are factored in to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resulting keyboard shortcut. That is, a key equivalent whose raw value is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the capitalized string “A” corresponds with the keyboard shortcut"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Command-Shift-A. The exact mapping may depend on the keyboard layout—for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, a key equivalent with the character value “}” produces a shortcut"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"equivalent to Command-Shift-] on ANSI keyboards, but would produce a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different shortcut for keyboard layouts where punctuation characters are in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different locations."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/KeyEquivalent/leftArrow":{"title":"leftArrow","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"leftArrow","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyEquivalent","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13KeyEquivalentV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/keyequivalent\/leftarrow","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/leftArrow","abstract":[{"text":"Left Arrow (U